# Force LF in working copies. With core.autocrlf=true on Windows a fresh clone would otherwise hand
# out CRLF, and the shell scripts under container-assets/ are COPY'd straight into the Linux image —
# a CRLF shebang there fails as "/bin/sh^M: bad interpreter". The build currently only works because
# the working tree happens to hold LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.vsix binary
